@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route114_Text_LennyIntro
Hoenn_Route114_Text_LennyIntro::
	.string "Yodelayhihoo!\p"
	.string "… …\p"
	.string "You're supposed to shout\n"
	.string "“yodelayhihoo” since it doesn't\l"
	.string "echo here!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route114_Text_LennyDefeat
Hoenn_Route114_Text_LennyDefeat::
	.string "Yodelayhihoo!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route114_Text_LennyPostBattle
Hoenn_Route114_Text_LennyPostBattle::
	.string "When I was a wee tyke, I believed there\n"
	.string "was someone copying me and shouting\l"
	.string "back, “Yodelayhihoo.”$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route114_Text_LucasIntro
Hoenn_Route114_Text_LucasIntro::
	.string "If you're not prepared, you shouldn't\n"
	.string "be up in the mountains!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route114_Text_LucasDefeat
Hoenn_Route114_Text_LucasDefeat::
	.string "The mountains are unforgiving…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route114_Text_LucasPostBattle
Hoenn_Route114_Text_LucasPostBattle::
	.string "In the winter, mountains turn deadly\n"
	.string "with blizzards and avalanches.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route114_Text_ShaneIntro
Hoenn_Route114_Text_ShaneIntro::
	.string "Camping's fun! You can fish, roast\n"
	.string "marshmallows, and tell spooky stories!\p"
	.string "But the best of all are the POKéMON\n"
	.string "battles!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route114_Text_ShaneDefeat
Hoenn_Route114_Text_ShaneDefeat::
	.string "Way too strong!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route114_Text_ShanePostBattle
Hoenn_Route114_Text_ShanePostBattle::
	.string "I think it's great that I can go\n"
	.string "camping with my POKéMON.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route114_Text_NancyIntro
Hoenn_Route114_Text_NancyIntro::
	.string "I need to exercise after a meal.\n"
	.string "Let's have a match!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route114_Text_NancyDefeat
Hoenn_Route114_Text_NancyDefeat::
	.string "Oh, no!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route114_Text_NancyPostBattle
Hoenn_Route114_Text_NancyPostBattle::
	.string "I just had a tasty meal.\n"
	.string "I'm getting drowsy…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route114_Text_SteveIntro
Hoenn_Route114_Text_SteveIntro::
	.string "Ufufufufufu…\n"
	.string "Want to battle against my POKéMON?$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route114_Text_SteveDefeat
Hoenn_Route114_Text_SteveDefeat::
	.string "M-My POKéMON…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route114_Text_StevePostBattle
Hoenn_Route114_Text_StevePostBattle::
	.string "A big body that's all lumpy and hard,\n"
	.string "enormous horns, and vicious fangs…\p"
	.string "Ufufufufu…\n"
	.string "I wish I had a POKéMON like that…$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/Route114/scripts.inc: Route114_Text_AllMyMonDoesIsRoarTakeThis
Hoenn_Route114_Text_AllMyMonDoesIsRoarTakeThis::
	.string "All my POKéMON does is ROAR…\n"
	.string "No one dares to come near me…\p"
	.string "Sigh… If you would, please take\n"
	.string "this TM away…$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/Route114/scripts.inc: Route114_Text_ExplainRoar
Hoenn_Route114_Text_ExplainRoar::
	.string "TM05 contains ROAR.\n"
	.string "A ROAR sends POKéMON scurrying.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route114_Text_NolanIntro
Hoenn_Route114_Text_NolanIntro::
	.string "I like to fish. But I also like to\n"
	.string "battle!\p"
	.string "If anyone challenges me, I'm there,\n"
	.string "even if I'm fishing.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route114_Text_NolanDefeat
Hoenn_Route114_Text_NolanDefeat::
	.string "I like to battle, but that doesn't\n"
	.string "mean I'm good at it…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route114_Text_NolanPostBattle
Hoenn_Route114_Text_NolanPostBattle::
	.string "This time I'll do it!\p"
	.string "I always think that, so I can't walk\n"
	.string "away from fishing or POKéMON.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route114_Text_ClaudeIntro
Hoenn_Route114_Text_ClaudeIntro::
	.string "If we were fishing, you wouldn't stand\n"
	.string "a chance against me.\l"
	.string "So, bring on your POKéMON!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route114_Text_ClaudeDefeat
Hoenn_Route114_Text_ClaudeDefeat::
	.string "If we were fishing, I would've won…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route114_Text_ClaudePostBattle
Hoenn_Route114_Text_ClaudePostBattle::
	.string "I think I'll try my luck at landing\n"
	.string "a big one at METEOR FALLS.\p"
	.string "There has to be something in there.\n"
	.string "I just know it.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route114_Text_BernieIntro
Hoenn_Route114_Text_BernieIntro::
	.string "If you're lighting a campfire,\n"
	.string "make sure you have water handy.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route114_Text_BernieDefeat
Hoenn_Route114_Text_BernieDefeat::
	.string "Thanks for dousing my fire!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route114_Text_BerniePostBattle
Hoenn_Route114_Text_BerniePostBattle::
	.string "You really do have to be careful with\n"
	.string "any sort of fire in a forest.\p"
	.string "Don't ever underestimate the power\n"
	.string "of fire.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route114_Text_IvyIntro
Hoenn_Route114_Text_IvyIntro::
	.string "IVY: Who taught you about POKéMON?$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route114_Text_IvyDefeat
Hoenn_Route114_Text_IvyDefeat::
	.string "IVY: What an amazing battle style!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route114_Text_IvyNotEnoughMons
Hoenn_Route114_Text_IvyNotEnoughMons::
	.string "IVY: Do you only have one POKéMON?\n"
	.string "I think it must feel lonesome.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route114_Text_IvyPostBattle
Hoenn_Route114_Text_IvyPostBattle::
	.string "IVY: I started training POKéMON\n"
	.string "because TYRA, my student mentor,\l"
	.string "taught me!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route114_Text_TyraIntro
Hoenn_Route114_Text_TyraIntro::
	.string "TYRA: Well, sure.\n"
	.string "I'm in the mood for it.\l"
	.string "I'll teach you a little about POKéMON.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route114_Text_TyraDefeat
Hoenn_Route114_Text_TyraDefeat::
	.string "TYRA: What an amazing battle style!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route114_Text_TyraNotEnoughMons
Hoenn_Route114_Text_TyraNotEnoughMons::
	.string "TYRA: Giggle…\n"
	.string "If you want to battle with us, just one\l"
	.string "POKéMON isn't enough!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route114_Text_TyraPostBattle
Hoenn_Route114_Text_TyraPostBattle::
	.string "TYRA: I was teaching my junior IVY\n"
	.string "about POKéMON.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route114_Text_CharlotteIntro
Hoenn_Route114_Text_CharlotteIntro::
	.string "Me!\n"
	.string "I'm not just a pretty face!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route114_Text_CharlotteDefeat
Hoenn_Route114_Text_CharlotteDefeat::
	.string "That wasn't cute in the least!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route114_Text_CharlottePostBattle
Hoenn_Route114_Text_CharlottePostBattle::
	.string "I don't want a POKéMON that's\n"
	.string "just cute.\p"
	.string "I adore cute ones that have a quirk\n"
	.string "or two!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route114_Text_AngelinaIntro
Hoenn_Route114_Text_AngelinaIntro::
	.string "Have you made your POKéMON evolve\n"
	.string "very much?$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route114_Text_AngelinaDefeat
Hoenn_Route114_Text_AngelinaDefeat::
	.string "Oh, I see.\n"
	.string "That's good to know.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route114_Text_AngelinaPostBattle
Hoenn_Route114_Text_AngelinaPostBattle::
	.string "Some POKéMON change so much when\n"
	.string "they evolve, it's startling!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route114_Text_KaiIntro
Hoenn_Route114_Text_KaiIntro::
	.string "I landed a big one!\n"
	.string "A huge one, I tell you!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route114_Text_KaiDefeat
Hoenn_Route114_Text_KaiDefeat::
	.string "What was that about?\n"
	.string "Did mine lose in size?$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route114_Text_KaiPostBattle
Hoenn_Route114_Text_KaiPostBattle::
	.string "Okay!\n"
	.string "I'll just fish me a bigger one!$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/Route114/scripts.inc: Route114_Text_MeteorFallsSign
Hoenn_Route114_Text_MeteorFallsSign::
	.string "METEOR FALLS\n"
	.string "RUSTBORO CITY THROUGH HERE$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/Route114/scripts.inc: Route114_Text_FossilManiacsHouseSign
Hoenn_Route114_Text_FossilManiacsHouseSign::
	.string "FOSSIL MANIAC'S HOUSE\n"
	.string "“Fossils gratefully accepted!”$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/Route114/scripts.inc: Route114_Text_LanettesHouse
Hoenn_Route114_Text_LanettesHouse::
	.string "LANETTE'S HOUSE$"
